message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the original project as well."
title: "Franka Panda Color Sorting Robot with ChromaPick geometry-based vision"
type: software
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-06
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/AbhishekDubasi09/Franka_Panda_Color_Sorting_Robot"
abstract: "An enhanced version of an open-source Franka Panda colour-sorting project for ROS 2 and MoveIt 2. The vision code replaces hand-tuned camera constants with ray-plane geometry and adaptive colour segmentation. In simulation, mean detection error against ground truth dropped from 89.6 mm to 1.1 mm."
keywords: [ros2, moveit2, franka-panda, gazebo, opencv, pick-and-place, computer-vision]
